---
// Circular profile photo, true color. One image works for both themes
// since natural color doesn't wash out against either background — the
// cyan ring alone carries the accent. Swap the source photo or its crop
// by regenerating public/images/avatar.png; everything else about the
// avatar (frame, border, sizing) lives here in one place.
---

<img class="avatar" src="/images/avatar.png" alt="Lawal Alabe" width="64" height="64" />

<style>
	.avatar {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 64px;
		height: 64px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: 2px solid #00bcd4;
		object-fit: cover;
	}
</style>
